        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].demand", "value": 53.35517948166476, "rtol": 1e-9, "note": "hand: 96000/3012.4740663 * 1.41^1.5 = 31.8674943*1.6742871 = 53.3551795 in — the pre-fix db^1.0 formula would have given 31.8674943*1.41 = 44.9331669 in (19% unconservative)" }
